            "paragraph": "Methane concentrations were analysed within a few hours after sampling. The dissolved gas was extracted from the water or brine by vacuum-ultrasonic treatment and subsequently measured with a gas chromatograph (Chrompack 9003 (GC) with a flame ionization detector (FID)). For gas chromatographic separation we used a packed column (Porapac Q 80/100 mesh).",
