            "target_entity_instance": "\u03b413CCH4 values",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "The \u03b413CCH4 values were determined using a Delta XP plus Finnigan mass spectrometer. The extracted gas was purged and trapped with PreCon equipment (Finnigan) to pre-concentrate the sample. All isotopic ratios were given in a \u03b4-notation relative to the Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite (VPDB) standard using conventional delta notation. The reproducibility derived from duplicates was 1\u20131.5\u2030.",
